{"seq":2,"slug":"ocr-idp-field-extraction","title":"IDP 字段抽取引擎与置信度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/invoice-capture-extract/ocr-idp-field-extraction","wordCount":3438,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"idp-字段抽取引擎与置信度模型\">IDP 字段抽取引擎与置信度模型</h1><p>一张供应商发票进入 AP 系统后，第一个真正的技术关卡不是&quot;能不能读出来&quot;，而是&quot;读出来的每个字段，系统有多大把握认为它对&quot;。OCR 只解决像素到字符，真正的难点在于把散落的文字归位成 <code>invoice_number</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>amount_due</code> 这样可下单、可对账、可申报的结构化字段，并为每个字段附上一个可比较、可校准、可据以路由的置信度。这篇文档拆开这条链路的建模方式、置信度的来源与合成、以及跨境票据特有的输入分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OCR（Optical Character Recognition）与 IDP（Intelligent Document Processing）不是同义词，把它们混为一谈是抽取引擎设计里最常见的起点错误。OCR 的输出是一条按阅读顺序排列的<strong>字符流加坐标</strong>，它不知道&quot; INV-2026-0042 &quot;是一个发票号还是一个 PO 号；IDP 在此之上叠加了四件事：<strong>字段定位</strong>（哪些 token 组成哪个字段）、<strong>语义归一化</strong>（日期化、金额化、货币码化）、<strong>业务校验</strong>（小计加税是否等于总额）、以及<strong>置信度评估</strong>。OCR 置信度衡量的是&quot;这个字符认对了没有&quot;，IDP 置信度衡量的是&quot;这个字段归对位了没有&quot;——后者才是决定是否自动过账的依据。</p>\n<p>AP 场景下要抽取的字段可以按可靠性分层。低熵、格式强约束的字段（发票号、日期、货币码）通常抽取准确率最高；高熵、版式自由的字段（供应商名称、地址、行项目描述）最容易出错；而<strong>合计类字段</strong>（净额、税额、应付总额）虽然文本好认，但一旦版式里有折扣行、预付款行或多次税额行，归位逻辑就极其容易张冠李戴。因此字段分类不是按位置分，而是按&quot;归位歧义度&quot;分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始票据&lt;br/&gt;PDF / 扫描件 / 邮件附件 / XML] --&gt; B{是否含结构化载荷}&#10;    B -- 含 XML/UBL/CII --&gt; C[直接解析结构&lt;br/&gt;跳过 OCR]&#10;    B -- 仅图像/文本层 --&gt; D[OCR 或版面识别&lt;br/&gt;输出 token + 坐标]&#10;    C --&gt; E[字段定位与语义归一化]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[跨字段业务校验&lt;br/&gt;算术 / 主数据 / 时间窗]&#10;    F --&gt; G[置信度合成与门控]&#10;    G -- 高置信 --&gt; H[直通入账 STP]&#10;    G -- 低置信 --&gt; I[人工复核 HITL]&#10;    I --&gt; J[修正结果回流&lt;br/&gt;主动学习]&#10;    J --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[原始票据&lt;br/&gt;PDF / 扫描件 / 邮件附件 / XML] --&gt; B{是否含结构化载荷}\n    B -- 含 XML/UBL/CII --&gt; C[直接解析结构&lt;br/&gt;跳过 OCR]\n    B -- 仅图像/文本层 --&gt; D[OCR 或版面识别&lt;br/&gt;输出 token + 坐标]\n    C --&gt; E[字段定位与语义归一化]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[跨字段业务校验&lt;br/&gt;算术 / 主数据 / 时间窗]\n    F --&gt; G[置信度合成与门控]\n    G -- 高置信 --&gt; H[直通入账 STP]\n    G -- 低置信 --&gt; I[人工复核 HITL]\n    I --&gt; J[修正结果回流&lt;br/&gt;主动学习]\n    J --&gt; E</pre><p>理解这条流水线的关键在最后一条回路：人工复核不是成本中心，而是<strong>训练数据的来源</strong>。每一次人工修正都是一条被标注的样本，也是校准置信度阈值所需的真值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽取的三种范式-模板-版面模型与多模态大模型\">抽取的三种范式：模板、版面模型与多模态大模型</h2><p>抽出&quot; INV-2026-0042 &quot;有多条实现路径，成本、泛化性与可解释性差异极大，必须按供应商群分层选择，而不是全量套用一种。</p>\n<p><strong>锚点/模板抽取</strong>用关键词或正则定位字段：搜索&quot;发票号&quot;&quot;Invoice No.&quot;后的首个匹配 token。它对版式固定的少数大供应商极其精确、几乎零延迟、完全可解释，但每换一种版式就要新写规则，规则数随供应商数线性膨胀，维护成本最终压垮团队。</p>\n<p><strong>版面感知的深度学习模型</strong>（LayoutLM 系列、Donut 等）把文本、坐标与视觉特征一起喂进模型直接输出字段标签，能泛化到没见过的新版式，是当代商用 IDP 服务的主流底座。代价是需要标注数据、推理有延迟，失败时难以解释&quot;为什么把这个数字当成了总额&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>多模态大模型抽取</strong>把整页图像或文本层交给 VLM，用提示词要求返回结构化 JSON。它上手最快、对多语言与非常见版式最宽容，但输出不稳定、成本随 token 线性上升，且原始概率不可得——大模型的&quot;口头自信&quot;不是校准过的置信度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>泛化性</th>\n<th>可解释性</th>\n<th>单票成本</th>\n<th>置信度可得性</th>\n<th>适合的供应商分层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锚点/模板规则</td>\n<td>低（版式绑定）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>规则命中即可靠</td>\n<td>少数高频大供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版面感知模型</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>字段级概率</td>\n<td>主体供应商群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模态大模型</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（按 token）</td>\n<td>需另做校准</td>\n<td>长尾、新供应商、冷启动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的成熟做法是<strong>级联</strong>：先跑结构化解析（见下节），再跑模板规则，命不中才落到版面模型，仍低置信才交给大模型兜底或直接转人工。级联让多数流量走最便宜、最确定的路径，把昂贵算力留给真正困难的少数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度不是单一数字-多信号合成与校准\">置信度不是单一数字：多信号合成与校准</h2><p>商用抽取服务返回的置信度有明确结构。以 AWS Textract 的 <code>AnalyzeExpense</code> 为例，返回体里每个字段（<code>SummaryFields</code>、<code>LineItemGroups</code>）都带 <code>Confidence</code> 数值，且<strong>标签（<code>LabelDetection</code>）和值（<code>ValueDetection</code>）各自独立带一个置信度</strong>——这意味着&quot;型号&quot;这个标签被认对了、但后面跟的那个值认错了的失败模式是可被捕获的。该 API 的 <code>Confidence</code> 定义域为 0–100 的百分比（见 <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/textract/latest/dg/API_AnalyzeExpense.html\">Textract AnalyzeExpense API 参考</a>）。Google Document AI 的 Invoice Parser 则直接输出规范化的单头字段与行项目字段（<code>invoice_id</code>、<code>total_amount</code>、<code>net_amount</code>、<code>vat/tax_amount</code> 等），把归一化（日期、金额、货币、VAT）做进了处理器内部（见 <a href=\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/document-ai/docs/processors-list\">Document AI 处理器列表</a>）。</p>\n<p>单靠 OCR 服务返回的数字是不够的，因为它衡量的是&quot;字符识别&quot;而非&quot;字段归位&quot;。工程上应合成一个<strong>多信号置信度</strong>，至少包含四路：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>field</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>ocr</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>model</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>rule</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>cross</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{field}} = w_1 C*{\\text{ocr}} + w*2 C*{\\text{model}} + w*3 C*{\\text{rule}} + w*4 C*{\\text{cross}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">field</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ocr</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">model</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rule</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cross</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ocr</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ocr}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ocr</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是字符级识别置信度（取字段跨度内字符的最小值或分位数，而不是平均值——一个字段里只要有一个字符是错的，整串就不可信），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是抽取模型的字段级概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rule</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rule}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rule</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自确定性校验（货币码是否在 ISO 4217 集合内、日期是否可解析、发票号是否符合供应商主数据里的格式），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>cross</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{cross}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来自跨字段一致性。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不应度假想定，而要按供应商群用历史人工修正数据回归拟合。</p>\n<p>置信度能否当作概率用，取决于它<strong>是否校准</strong>。一个模型可以排序很好（A 字段比 B 字段更可能对）却系统性过度自信（说 95% 而实际只有 80% 对）。衡量校准的标准工具是<strong>期望校准误差（Expected Calibration Error, ECE）</strong>：把预测按置信度分箱，比较每个箱内的平均置信度与实测准确率之差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ECE} = \\sum\\_{m=1}^{M} \\frac{|B_m|}{n} \\left| \\mathrm{acc}(B_m) - \\mathrm{conf}(B_m) \\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ECE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是箱数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是落入第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 箱的预测集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{acc}(B_m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该箱实测正确率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{conf}(B_m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">conf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该箱平均置信度。ECE 越小越接近完美校准（定义见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calibration_(statistics)\">Calibration (statistics)</a>）。可靠的做法是定期用人工复核结果画<strong>可靠性图</strong>：以平均置信度为横轴、实测正确率为纵轴，理想模型落在 45° 对角线上；点落在对角线下方说明过度自信（这是商用模型的常态），需要做温度缩放或等渗回归来压低置信度。</p>\n<p>跨字段一致性信号在发票场景特别强，值得单独加权。常见的硬约束包括：行项目金额之和（扣折扣、加运费）应等于净额；净额加税额应等于总额；<code>issue_date</code> 不晚于 <code>due_date</code>；币种与供应商主数据一致。<strong>任何一条算术校验失败，无论 OCR 置信度多高，该文档都必须降级复核</strong>——这是唯一能把&quot;认对了字但归错了位&quot;这类错误拦下来的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境票据的输入分布-结构化优先\">跨境票据的输入分布：结构化优先</h2><p>跨境 AP 与纯境内 AP 最大的差异在输入分布：欧盟的电子发票强制化进程意味着<strong>越来越多票据在源头就是结构化的</strong>，对它们做 OCR 是纯粹的浪费。欧洲标准 EN 16931 定义了电子发票核心语义数据模型，其规范版本中 <code>BT-1</code>（发票号）、<code>BT-2</code>（开票日期）、<code>BT-5</code>（币种）、<code>BT-109</code>（不含税总额）、<code>BT-110</code>（税额）、<code>BT-112</code>（应付金额）等为必填语义元素，Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 将这些元素绑定到 UBL 语法并配有 Schematron 校验规则（见 <a href=\"https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/billing/3.0/\">Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 文档</a>）。抽取引擎对这类输入的&quot;字段抽取&quot;退化成&quot;元素映射&quot;，置信度天然为满值或零（存在即确定），无需 OCR。</p>\n<p>另一种混合形态是 <strong>Factur-X / ZUGFeRD</strong>：外层是 PDF/A-3，内嵌 CII 语法的 XML。同一份票据既能人眼阅读又能机器解析。它的当前信息包版本为 <strong>2.5.2（2026-08-04 发布）</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://www.ferd-net.de/standards/zugferd/\">FeRD ZUGFeRD 标准页</a>）。抽取引擎必须先探测 PDF 内是否挂载了 XML 附件，命中则直读 XML；这是&quot;结构化优先&quot;原则的典型落点。欧盟 ViDA 改革（2025-03-11 通过、2025-04-14 生效）规定跨境 B2B 的数字报告义务自 <strong>2030-07-01</strong> 起以电子发票为支撑，各国既有实时报告系统须在 <strong>2035-01-01</strong> 前对齐欧盟模型（见 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/taxation/vat/vat-digital-age-vida_en\">欧盟委员会 ViDA 页面</a>）——这预示着图像类票据的比例会持续下降。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>票据形态</th>\n<th>抽取路径</th>\n<th>置信度性质</th>\n<th>跨境要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Peppol/UBL 电子发票</td>\n<td>XML 元素映射</td>\n<td>存在即确定（满值/零）</td>\n<td>强制 EN 16931 语义元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Factur-X / ZUGFeRD</td>\n<td>探测 PDF/A-3 内嵌 XML</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>CII 语法，当前版本 2.5.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生 PDF（有文本层）</td>\n<td>文本层直接抽取</td>\n<td>来自版面模型</td>\n<td>注意列错位、跨页总额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扫描件 / 手机拍照</td>\n<td>OCR + 版面模型</td>\n<td>需校准的多信号合成</td>\n<td>多语言、手写、票据弯曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件内联 / 附件</td>\n<td>先分类再走上行路径</td>\n<td>继承其内容形态</td>\n<td>附件类型与编码识别</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>图像类票据里，跨境还要额外应对<strong>多书写系统</strong>：拉丁字母之外的西里尔、阿拉伯、汉字混排，阿拉伯数字的变体字形，以及千分位与小数分隔符的地区差异（<code>1.234,56</code> 与 <code>1,234.56</code> 语义相反）。金额归一化必须显式带<strong>地区假设</strong>，否则同一串数字会被解成差三个数量级的值——这类错误一旦漏过，会直接污染下游的付款金额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度门控与人工复核路由\">置信度门控与人工复核路由</h2><p>置信度最终要落到一个<strong>路由决策</strong>上：自动过账，还是转人工。路由粒度有两种，实务中应当混用。<strong>文档级路由</strong>取该文档所有关键字段置信度的最小值，低于阈值整单转人工；它简单但会因一个无关小数（如某个行项目描述）拖累整单。<strong>字段级路由</strong>只把低置信字段高亮送审，其余自动通过——它把人工工作量降到最低，但要求复核界面能定位到具体字段坐标区域，且下游流程要能接受&quot;部分自动、部分待审&quot;的中间状态。</p>\n<p>阈值不该拍脑袋定，而应由<strong>目标指标反推</strong>。两个关键指标是：<strong>直通处理率（Straight-Through Processing, STP rate）</strong>——无需人工即完成入账的比例；以及<strong>错误过账率</strong>——高置信自动通过但事后被对账或审计发现错误的比例。把阈值调高，STP 下降、人工成本上升、错误过账下降；调低则相反。合理做法是选定一个可接受的错误过账率上限（例如以财务重要性为界），在该约束下最大化 STP。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>置信度区间</th>\n<th>路由动作</th>\n<th>典型字段</th>\n<th>复核成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高（≥0.95，且算术校验通过）</td>\n<td>直通自动入账</td>\n<td>发票号、日期、币种、总额</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中（0.70–0.95）</td>\n<td>自动通过但打标，抽样审计</td>\n<td>供应商名称、行项目</td>\n<td>低（抽样）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低（&lt;0.70，或算术校验失败）</td>\n<td>强制人工复核</td>\n<td>高熵字段、合计类字段</td>\n<td>高（逐单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失/无法定位</td>\n<td>拒绝入账并回退供应商</td>\n<td>必填语义元素缺失</td>\n<td>极高（对外沟通）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复核回路的价值不止于纠错。每次人工修正都应<strong>结构化回流</strong>到训练与规则集：若是新版式导致，则补锚点规则；若是模型系统性错误，则作为标注样本进入再训练；若是阈值不当，则据真值重算 ECE 并调整温度参数。这条回路让置信度随时间真正收敛，而不是停在出厂状态。放弃主动学习——把修正结果只存进单据日志而不回流——是 AP 自动化项目最常见的价值泄漏点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>OCR ≠ IDP</strong>：前者产出字符流与坐标，后者产出可入账字段加可校准置信度；决定是否自动过账的是后者。</li>\n<li><strong>按归位歧义度而非位置给字段分层</strong>：合计类字段文本好认但最易归错位，是校验信号的主要用武之地。</li>\n<li><strong>三种范式应级联而非二选一</strong>：模板规则、版面模型、多模态大模型各自的成本与泛化性不同，按供应商分层调度。</li>\n<li><strong>置信度必须合成并校准</strong>：融合 OCR 字符置信度、模型概率、规则命中与跨字段算术校验；用 ECE 与可靠性图定期验证它是否可当概率用。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境场景结构化优先</strong>：Peppol/EN 16931 与 Factur-X/ZUGFeRD（当前 2.5.2）让&quot;抽取&quot;退化成&quot;映射&quot;，ViDA 时间表（跨境 B2B 报告 2030-07-01 起）预示图像票据占比将持续下降。</li>\n<li><strong>门控由目标指标反推</strong>：以错误过账率上限为约束最大化 STP，并让每次人工修正回流为规则或训练样本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章节其余文档从另外两个角度展开同一链路：<a href=\"./\">发票采集与抽取章节索引</a> 列出本节的完整文档序列，<a href=\"../\">本 hub 索引</a> 给出与其他章节（匹配审批、付款与 VAT、欺诈与营运资金）的边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IDP 字段抽取引擎与置信度模型","id":"idp-字段抽取引擎与置信度模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"抽取的三种范式：模板、版面模型与多模态大模型","id":"抽取的三种范式-模板-版面模型与多模态大模型"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度不是单一数字：多信号合成与校准","id":"置信度不是单一数字-多信号合成与校准"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境票据的输入分布：结构化优先","id":"跨境票据的输入分布-结构化优先"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度门控与人工复核路由","id":"置信度门控与人工复核路由"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"发票接入渠道与单据格式模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/invoice-capture-extract/invoice-intake-channels-formats"},"next":{"title":"抽取校验、重复检测与人工复核异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/accounts-payable-invoice-automation/invoice-capture-extract/extraction-validation-human-review"}}